<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals committee meeting to be routine.</title>
<headline>EU cereals committee meeting to be routine.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will set the annual amount for the supply of subsidised rice to the Canary Islands at an otherwise routine meeting on Thursday, a member state official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee is due to set the amount of rice into the Canary Isles for the year and will deal with all the usual weekly tenders,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
